    "title": "Kids School Games",
    "description": "Ages 2-6. Fun & Easy for toddlers. Made for kids in Preschool & Kindergarten.\r\n\r\n\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605 What's inside? \u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\r\n\r\n\u2605Flashcards\u2605\r\nToddlers can swipe through flashcards that will help them learn the alphabet, numbers, shapes, colors, and animals.\r\n\r\n\u2605Bubble Game\u2605\r\nThis mini game is for kids familiar with the alphabet.  Try to pop the bubbles in order from A-Z.  You need to be quick to finish within the time limit.\r\n\r\n\u2605Counting\u2605\r\nPractice counting with cute little kittens and puppies.\r\n\r\n\u2605Puzzles\u2605\r\nEnjoy over 20 puzzles with themes such as Halloween, cooking, zoo animals, monster trucks, birthday wish, dinosaurs, sports and more.\r\n\r\n\u2605Coloring\u2605\r\nShow off your artistic talent with our high quality coloring book.  There are coloring pages for boys and girls of all interests such as boats, farm animals, dogs, cars, planes, ocean animals, basketball, and more.\r\n\r\n\u2605Matching\u2605\r\nStrengthen your child's memory skills with a card matching game. Match capital letters to lowercase letters, numbers, shapes, animals, and colors.\r\n\r\n\u2605What's Different?\u2605\r\nTry to find the differences in near identical pictures.  Some are very easy to find and some are a bit of a challenge.\r\n\r\n\u2605Writing/Tracing\u2605\r\nPractice writing the alphabet, numbers, and shapes.\r\n\r\n\u2605Piano\u2605\r\nPractice your music skills by creating some melodic tunes on the piano.\r\n\r\n\u2605ABC Tap\u2605\r\nYour toddler or baby screen mashers can enjoy this one. Just tap on the screen and sing along to the ABC song.\r\n\r\n\u2605Pizza\u2605\r\nThis one is just for fun. Kids can make a yummy pizza with any ingredients they choose.\r\n\r\n\u2605Add & Subtract\u2605\r\nIf your child needs a bit of a challenge, test their math skills with this section.\r\n\r\n\u2605Calendar\u2605\r\nLearn the days of the week and months.\r\n\r\n\u2605Spelling\u2605\r\nLearning to spell can be challenging.  Have fun using stickers to spell 3-4 letter words.\r\n\r\n\u2605Quiz\u2605\r\nWhen your child thinks they've learned it all, test their knowledge with this little quiz. It will ask them 5 multiple choice questions from each section (alphabet, numbers, colors, shapes, and animals) and give a final report.\r\n\r\n\u2605Other Notes\u2605\r\nEnglish and Spanish available\r\nAll games are playable for free\r\n\r\nIngl\u00e9s y espa\u00f1ol disponibles\r\nTodos los juegos se pueden jugar gratis",
